import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.HolomorphicExponentialSheafIntegersULift

/-!
# Actual integer sheaves for the holomorphic exponential sequence

This family constructs the native constant additive integer sheaf and
its inclusion into the genuine holomorphic function sheaf by the period
`2 * π * I` of the ordinary complex exponential. The sheafification unit,
its local integer representatives, universal property, and the actual
monomorphism are all proved without connectedness assumptions.

The canonical comparison with the native constant sheaf on `ULift ℤ`
used by sheaf cohomology is also included. Exponentiation and exactness
are proved separately in the exponential-sequence companion files.
-/
